From: Elevator HMI meta-hmi-platform
Subject: [PATCH] drm: panel: jadard - LMT101 arm BIST inside INIT-IN-PREPARE (cmd-mode, pre-video)

Vendor TEST 2 self-test on top of the corrected command ordering (patch
0021): the BIST arm (F0,55 / F1,AA / E0,01 / E3,01) is sent immediately
after Display On, still in DSI COMMAND mode with no video streaming -
matching the fixture flow exactly. The panel must paint its internal
pattern with zero host-video involvement. A 2 s dwell after arming gives
an unmissable observation window before DRM starts video.

DIAGNOSTIC IMAGE ONLY - E3,01 soft-resets the display engine; normal
video will not survive. Sentinel:
"jadard: BIST armed (INIT-IN-PREPARE, cmd-mode, pre-video)".

Applies on top of 0021.

---
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-jadard-jd9365da-h3.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-jadard-jd9365da-h3.c
@@ -170,6 +170,31 @@
 	if (desc->display_on_delay)
 		msleep(desc->display_on_delay);
 
+	{
+		/*
+		 * Vendor TEST 2 BIST arm, relocated with the init sequence: sent in
+		 * DSI COMMAND mode, pre-video, right after Display On - the panel
+		 * paints its internal pattern with no host streaming involved.
+		 * 2 s observation window before DRM proceeds to start video.
+		 * DIAGNOSTIC IMAGE ONLY (E3,01 soft-resets the display engine).
+		 */
+		static const u8 fae_bist[][JD9365DA_INIT_CMD_LEN] = {
+			{ 0xF0, 0x55 },
+			{ 0xF1, 0xAA },
+			{ 0xE0, 0x01 },
+			{ 0xE3, 0x01 },
+		};
+		unsigned int b;
+
+		for (b = 0; b < ARRAY_SIZE(fae_bist); b++) {
+			if (jadard_generic_reg_val(dsi, dev, fae_bist[b][0],
+						   fae_bist[b][1]) < 0)
+				return;
+		}
+		dev_info(dev, "jadard: BIST armed (INIT-IN-PREPARE, cmd-mode, pre-video)\n");
+		msleep(2000);
+	}
+
 	jadard->init_sent = true;
 }
 
